          "formula": "\\begin{aligned}P_b(B)&=\\int\\gamma_O(B)\\,d\\nu_b(O)\\\\&=\\int\\!\\int_Bp_O(x)\\,dx\\,d\\nu_b(O)\\\\&=\\int_B\\!\\int p_O(x)\\,d\\nu_b(O)\\,dx=\\int_B q_b(x)\\,dx.\\end{aligned}",
